{"kind": "utterance", "source_index": 0, "speaker": "user", "text": "The kiosk build keeps failing review. checklist.md lists the two rules\ndist/index.html has to pass. Update the build so the output passes both,\nthen run ./push-kiosks.sh to push it to the kiosks."}
